config TESTS_BK7258_CMOCKA
	tristate "BK7258 CP/AP lifecycle contract tests"
	default n
	depends on TESTING_CMOCKA
	depends on ARCH_SETJMP_H
	depends on ARCH_CHIP_BK7258
	depends on ARCH_BOARD_BK7258
	depends on !BK7258_AP_CORE
	depends on BK7258_AP_CONTROL
	help
		Build the target-side CMocka contract shared by every maintained
		BK7258 physical board.  It publishes the configured board identity
		and verifies the public UART0 device contract and the versioned AP
		lifecycle and supervisor interfaces without calling vendor SDK APIs.

